  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Emergency WASH Assistance to Refugees and Host Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM is providing life-saving and sustainable access to safe water, sanitation and hygiene services to South Sudanese and Congolese refugees and host communities in Uganda. Specifically, IOM is extending water pipelines and providing pumping facilities to reach underserved communities. IOM is also constructing latrines and providing digging kits in order to facilitate the construction of latrines to refugee households. Hygiene promotion activities are also carried out through this project.</narrative>
  </description>
